DESCRIPTION=Major release 4.0.0 after 3.3.0: treat the prior 3.3 line as superseded by this milestone semver. Repository policy no longer requires CodeRabbit or Codex CLIs, install attempts, triage gates, or a no-push rule tied to those tools; use normal GitHub review and optional integrations the maintainers enable.
